This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the appellant-petitioner being aggrieved by the judgment and award dated 25.02.2017 passed in MVC No.413/2013 by the II Addl. Senior Civil Judge & MACT.,
Kalaburagi, (hereinafter referred to as 'the Tribunal', for short).
